{"seq":1,"slug":"apiserver-scalability","title":"apiserver：限流、watch 分页与请求开销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-at-scale-performance/control-plane-scale/apiserver-scalability","wordCount":2434,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"apiserver-限流-watch-分页与请求开销\">apiserver：限流、watch 分页与请求开销</h1><p>在 50 节点的集群里，apiserver 的 CPU 使用率通常趴在 5% 以下，你会以为它永远不是瓶颈。到 3000 节点时，同样一套代码的 apiserver 会在某个下午突然开始返回 <code>429 Too Many Requests</code> 和 <code>Timeout: request did not complete within requested timeout</code>——而此时 CPU 可能仍然只有 40%。原因在于 apiserver 的扩展性瓶颈很少是 CPU 算力，而是请求排队、序列化开销与 watch 扇出的组合效应。本篇拆解请求从进入 apiserver 到穿透 etcd 的完整路径，给出每一层的可控参数与规模拐点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>apiserver 是一个无状态的反向代理 + 准入 + 编解码器 + REST 层，它的上游是 etcd quorum。请求的成本结构大致分三段：<strong>编解码</strong>（protobuf/JSON 序列化、GVK 转换、默认值填充）、<strong>准入与鉴权</strong>（webhook 调用、RBAC 判定、缓存查找）、<strong>存储</strong>（穿透到 etcd 的读或写，或在 watch cache 上命中）。规模上去之后，第三段通常不是最贵的——最贵的是第二段的 webhook 与第一段的序列化，因为它们与对象大小和对象数量直接相关。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>典型单请求开销</th>\n<th>规模敏感度</th>\n<th>主要缓解手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>鉴权/准入</td>\n<td>0.1–5 ms（无 webhook）；5–50 ms（有 webhook）</td>\n<td>与 QPS 线性，与对象大小无关</td>\n<td>RBAC 缓存、缩小 webhook 的 <code>rules</code> 范围、<code>failurePolicy</code> 选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码/解码</td>\n<td>0.2–2 ms（1KB 对象）；10–100 ms（1MB 对象）</td>\n<td>与对象字节数近似线性</td>\n<td><code>Accept: application/vnd.kubernetes.protobuf</code>、<code>--watch-cache</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>watch 事件派发</td>\n<td>每事件 10–100 μs</td>\n<td>与 watcher 数量 × 事件数成正比</td>\n<td>watch cache、<code>--min-request-timeout</code>、bookmark</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd 读</td>\n<td>1–10 ms</td>\n<td>与返回 KV 数量线性</td>\n<td>分页 <code>limit</code>、一致性读走 cache</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd 写</td>\n<td>5–50 ms（fsync 主导）</td>\n<td>与 QPS 线性，与对象大小弱相关</td>\n<td>减少写放大、SSD、批量合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的事实：<strong>对象大小对 apiserver 的影响比对 etcd 更大</strong>。etcd 的写延迟主要由 fsync 决定，一个 2KB 的 ConfigMap 和一个 200KB 的 ConfigMap 写入延迟差别不大；但 apiserver 必须序列化、深度拷贝、并在内存中为每个 watcher 保留一份 event 副本，200KB 的对象在 500 个 watcher 面前就是 100MB 的瞬时内存与序列化工作量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[kubectl / controller 发起请求] --&gt; B[HTTP 层 max-in-flight 并发闸门]&#10;    B --&gt; C[API Priority and Fairness 队列]&#10;    C --&gt; D[鉴权 RBAC 缓存]&#10;    D --&gt; E[准入 webhook 链]&#10;    E --&gt; F{读还是写?}&#10;    F --&gt;|读| G[watch cache 命中?]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[直接返回不碰 etcd]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[穿透 etcd Range]&#10;    F --&gt;|写| J[etcd 写事务 + fsync]&#10;    J --&gt; K[watch 事件广播给所有 watcher]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    H --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[kubectl / controller 发起请求] --&gt; B[HTTP 层 max-in-flight 并发闸门]\n    B --&gt; C[API Priority and Fairness 队列]\n    C --&gt; D[鉴权 RBAC 缓存]\n    D --&gt; E[准入 webhook 链]\n    E --&gt; F{读还是写?}\n    F --&gt;|读| G[watch cache 命中?]\n    G --&gt;|是| H[直接返回不碰 etcd]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[穿透 etcd Range]\n    F --&gt;|写| J[etcd 写事务 + fsync]\n    J --&gt; K[watch 事件广播给所有 watcher]\n    I --&gt; K\n    H --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"max-in-flight-与两级并发闸门\">max-in-flight 与两级并发闸门</h2><p>apiserver 有两套并发控制，且必须同时理解才能调对。</p>\n<p>第一套是<strong>传统的 max-in-flight</strong>，按请求类型分成三个计数器：<code>--max-requests-inflight</code>（读，默认 400）、<code>--max-mutating-requests-inflight</code>（写，默认 200），以及 <code>--max-requests-inflight</code> 在 1.31 之后与 priority level 体系结合后的行为。超出的请求直接返回 429，不做排队。这套机制简单，但在大集群里有一个致命缺陷：它不区分请求的来源和重要性，一个失控的 controller 疯狂 list 会挤掉 kubelet 的心跳上报，而心跳丢失会直接把节点判成 NotReady。</p>\n<p>第二套是 <strong>API Priority and Fairness（APF）</strong>，自 1.20 起默认启用，是当前推荐的做法。APF 把请求映射到 <code>PriorityLevelConfiguration</code>，每个 priority level 有独立的并发上限（<code>nominalConcurrencyShares</code>）与排队队列，并且用 <strong>shuffle sharding</strong> 把队列拆成多个子队列以避免单个大流量客户端占满整个队列。当 APF 启用时（<code>--enable-priority-and-fairness=true</code>，默认），max-in-flight 的三个计数器不再生效——这是很多人调参无效的原因：改了 <code>--max-requests-inflight</code> 却发现限流行为毫无变化。</p>\n<p>关键的 <code>FlowSchema</code> 是把「谁发的请求」映射到 priority level 的规则。默认安装的 <code>system</code>、<code>workload-leader-election</code>、<code>kube-scheduler</code>、<code>node-high</code>、<code>system-node-high</code> 等 FlowSchema 覆盖了主要的内置客户端。生产集群里最需要做的是为<strong>自研 controller 与批处理客户端</strong>建一个独立的 FlowSchema 与 priority level，否则它们会落到默认的 <code>global-default</code>（<code>nominalConcurrencyShares: 20</code>）或 <code>catch-all</code>，与成千上万个其他客户端抢同一份并发预算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: FlowSchema&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: batch-controller-low&#10;spec:&#10;  matchingPrecedence: 500&#10;  priorityLevelConfiguration:&#10;    name: batch-low&#10;  rules:&#10;    - subjects:&#10;        - kind: ServiceAccount&#10;          serviceAccount:&#10;            name: batch-controller&#10;            namespace: pipeline&#10;      resourceRules:&#10;        - verbs: [&#39;*&#39;]&#10;          apiGroups: [&#39;*&#39;]&#10;          resources: [&#39;*&#39;]&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: PriorityLevelConfiguration&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: batch-low&#10;spec:&#10;  type: Limited&#10;  limited:&#10;    nominalConcurrencyShares: 10&#10;    limitResponse:&#10;      type: Queue&#10;      queuing:&#10;        queues: 16&#10;        queueLengthLimit: 64&#10;        handSize: 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FlowSchema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch-controller-low</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  matchingPrecedence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  priorityLevelConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch-low</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">subjects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ServiceAccount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          serviceAccount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch-controller</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resourceRules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">verbs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          apiGroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PriorityLevelConfiguration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch-low</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Limited</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limited</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    nominalConcurrencyShares</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limitResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      queuing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        queues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        queueLengthLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        handSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span></code></pre></div><p>队列耗尽时 <code>limitResponse.type: Queue</code> 会让请求排队而不是直接 429，但排队时间计入 <code>apiserver_request_duration_seconds</code>，会推高客户端的超时率。判断该用 <code>Queue</code> 还是 <code>Reject</code> 的依据是客户端是否有重试退避：kubelet 和 client-go 的 informer 都有，自研脚本通常没有。</p>\n<p>调优时的核心观测指标是 <code>apiserver_flowcontrol_rejected_requests_total</code>、<code>apiserver_flowcontrol_current_inqueue_requests</code> 和 <code>apiserver_flowcontrol_request_wait_duration_seconds</code>。如果某个 priority level 的排队时间中位数超过 1 秒，说明 <code>nominalConcurrencyShares</code> 分配不足或该 level 的上游请求本身就有病——后者的正确做法是修客户端（加限速器）而不是给它更多份额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"list-watch-在大对象集下的开销结构\">list/watch 在大对象集下的开销结构</h2><p>watch 机制是 Kubernetes 控制平面的核心抽象，也是最容易在规模上翻车的地方。一个 informer 启动时会先做一次 <strong>list</strong> 建立本地缓存，然后发起 <strong>watch</strong> 接收增量。在 5 万个 Pod 的集群里，一次全量 list 意味着：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>apiserver 从 watch cache（如果命中）或 etcd 取出全部 5 万个对象；</li>\n<li>按 <code>limit</code> 分页（默认分页由 apiserver 内部按字节预算决定，<code>--min-request-timeout</code> 与 <code>--max-resource-write-bytes</code> 相关）；</li>\n<li>为每个对象做 GVK 转换、序列化、发送；</li>\n<li>client-go 侧反序列化并填入 <code>Indexer</code>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个过程的内存峰值在 apiserver 侧由 response writer 的缓冲决定，在客户端侧由 <code>Indexer</code> 决定。真实的大集群事故往往是客户端先 OOM：5000 个节点 × 每个节点 30 个 Pod 的 <code>Node</code> informer 如果意外缓存了完整的 Pod spec，内存会直接翻倍。正确的做法是在 <code>SharedInformerFactory</code> 上使用 <code>WithTransform</code> 或 <code>metadata-only</code> 的 informer（<code>NewFilteredSharedInformerFactory</code> + <code>metav1.PartialObjectMetadata</code>），只保留需要判定的元数据。</p>\n<p><strong>分页与 <code>resourceVersion</code> 的一致性语义</strong>是另一个常见坑。当你用 <code>limit=500</code> 分页 list 时，apiserver 会在响应里返回 <code>continue</code> token；client-go 的 <code>pager</code> 会自动跟随。但如果中途缓存被压缩（etcd compact 发生在这期间），后续页会返回 <code>410 Gone</code>，客户端必须重新从头 list。这就是 <code>watch</code> 大量报 <code>too old resource version</code> 的来源。缓解手段是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>调大 etcd 的 <code>--auto-compaction-retention</code>（但会持续占用磁盘，收益与代价见 <a href=\"etcd-compaction\">etcd 规模化</a>）；</li>\n<li>在客户端用 <code>WatchList</code>（<code>sendInitialEvents=true</code> + <code>resourceVersionMatch=NotOlderThan</code>），这是 1.27 引入、1.29 后逐步稳定并默认开启的方式，它把 list 和 watch 合并成一次流式请求，消除了分页与 410 的窗口；</li>\n<li>给 informer 加 <code>resyncPeriod</code> 要谨慎，全量 resync 会周期性重新 list，在数万对象规模下这是稳定的 CPU 消耗源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>watch cache 与一致性读</strong>。apiserver 1.31 起提供了「从缓存一致读」（consistent reads from cache）的能力，1.34 引入了可快照的 cache（snapshottable cache）。核心机制是：watch cache 维护一个 <code>resourceVersion</code> 到对象的快照序列，读请求只要满足 <code>resourceVersion</code> 已经出现在快照里，就可以直接从缓存返回，无需穿透 etcd，同时保证「不小于请求的 RV」这一一致性保证。对于 <code>kubectl get pods</code> 这类读操作，这几乎消除了 etcd 读压力。</p>\n<p>一个重要的容量事实：<code>--watch-cache-sizes</code> 曾是需要手工按资源类型调优的参数，但 1.31 之后 apiserver 会根据可用内存动态调整默认值。仍然建议对大对象资源（<code>Pod</code>、<code>Node</code>、<code>EndpointSlice</code>、<code>Event</code>）显式设置，因为动态调整的启发式对 <code>Event</code> 这类短生命周期高写入资源容易失配。Event 是最典型的误判源：把它留在 etcd 里会导致无用的写放大，1.19 之后 <code>events.k8s.io/v1</code> 的 <code>Event</code> 仍写 etcd，但许多人会部署一个 Event 聚合器（如 <code>eventrouter</code> 或云厂商的替代品）把它们导出到日志系统并降低 <code>--event-ttl</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"请求开销的量化与容量估算\">请求开销的量化与容量估算</h2><p>要判断一个 apiserver 能撑多少节点，不能靠「官方说 5000 节点」，而要建立自己的成本模型。可用的方法是直接读 apiserver 暴露的指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>规模化判读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>apiserver_request_total{verb,resource,code}</code></td>\n<td>按动词与资源的请求计数</td>\n<td>找出谁在制造流量（通常是 <code>list</code> Event 或 <code>watch</code> Pod）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>apiserver_request_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>请求延迟直方图</td>\n<td>看 p99 是否被某个 verb 拖高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>apiserver_current_inflight_requests</code></td>\n<td>当前并发请求数</td>\n<td>持续贴近上限即需要 APF 调参或客户端限速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>apiserver_response_sizes</code></td>\n<td>响应字节数直方图</td>\n<td>找出大响应 API——这是客户端 OOM 的前兆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>apiserver_cache_list_total</code></td>\n<td>从 watch cache 返回的 list 数</td>\n<td>该值的比例反映了 cache 命中效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>etcd_request_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>穿透 etcd 的请求延迟</td>\n<td>若 p99 抬升而 apiserver CPU 不高，瓶颈在 etcd</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个粗略的容量估算模型：设集群有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点、每节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 个 Pod，则稳态下的读请求量近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>α</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{read} \\approx N \\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{T_{node}} + \\frac{p}{T_{pod}} \\cdot \\alpha\\right) + C_{ctrl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{node} \\approx 10\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 kubelet 的状态上报周期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{pod}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 Pod 状态变化的特征周期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是每 Pod 变化触发的事件数（含 watch 扇出），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{ctrl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是所有控制器自身轮询与 watch 的贡献。这个式子解释了两个反直觉的现象：<strong>每个 Pod 的成本远高于每个节点的成本</strong>（因为 Pod 变更频率高且被更多 watcher 关注），以及 <strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{ctrl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></span> 常常超过前两项</strong>（尤其在 Operator 多、reconcile 频繁的集群）。因此减少 apiserver 压力的最有效手段往往不是加机器，而是审计控制器的 <code>reconcile</code> 频率与其 informer 的 <code>resyncPeriod</code>。</p>\n<p>关于调度器与控制器如何以及在何处消耗 apiserver 配额，见 <a href=\"scheduler-controller-pressure\">调度器、控制器与 informer 积压</a>；而持久化层的延迟特性与压缩维护见 <a href=\"etcd-compaction\">etcd 规模化：压缩、去碎片化与磁盘延迟</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>apiserver 的瓶颈很少是 CPU，而是<strong>并发闸门、序列化开销、watch 扇出</strong>三者的叠加。</li>\n<li>APF 启用时 <code>--max-requests-inflight</code> 不再生效；限流调参必须改 <code>FlowSchema</code> 与 <code>PriorityLevelConfiguration</code>。为自研 controller 建独立 priority level 是最高收益的一步。</li>\n<li>对象大小对 apiserver 的伤害大于对 etcd 的伤害，因为它被序列化并被复制到每个 watcher。</li>\n<li><code>WatchList</code>（<code>sendInitialEvents</code>）消除了 list 分页与 <code>410 Gone</code> 的窗口，是大集群 informer 的首选启动方式。</li>\n<li>watch cache 的一致读让大量读请求完全不穿透 etcd；但 <code>Event</code> 类资源需要单独处理，避免用 etcd 存日志。</li>\n<li>建立自己的请求成本模型（按节点、按 Pod、按控制器分别计）比记住「5000 节点」这个数字更有用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"apiserver：限流、watch 分页与请求开销","id":"apiserver-限流-watch-分页与请求开销"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"max-in-flight 与两级并发闸门","id":"max-in-flight-与两级并发闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"list/watch 在大对象集下的开销结构","id":"list-watch-在大对象集下的开销结构"},{"level":2,"text":"请求开销的量化与容量估算","id":"请求开销的量化与容量估算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"etcd 规模化：压缩、去碎片化与磁盘延迟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-at-scale-performance/control-plane-scale/etcd-compaction"}}